    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="1264" n="1232" xml:id="pg1232"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <ref target="frus:frus1958-60v06"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1958–1960, Cuba, Volume
                        VI</ref>. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been revised.
                    <!--Revised information is in italic.--></p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d91-f3">Document 91, Footnote
                                3</ref>, Page 141 (date of correction: January 5, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>The citation to “footnote 4” of Document 86 has been corrected to
                        “footnote 3”.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">2. <ref target="#d92-f2">Document 92, Footnote
                                2</ref>, Page 142 (date of correction: January 5, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>The citation to “footnote 4” of Document 86 has been corrected to
                        “footnote 3”.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">3. <ref target="#d93-f2">Document 93, Footnote
                                2</ref>, Page 143 (date of correction: January 5, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>The citation to “footnote 4” of Document 86 has been corrected to
                        “footnote 3”.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">4. <ref target="#d203-f1">Document 203, Footnote
                                1</ref>, Page 330 (date of correction: September 2,
                        2022)</hi></item>
                    <item>The Central File citation “737.00/12–3158” in footnote 1 has been
                        corrected to “737.00/12–1358”.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
